<p>In the <a class="" href=/tutorials/tutorial-five-dotnet-amqp10>previous tutorial</a> we used topic exchanges. In this tutorial we implement <strong>request/reply</strong> (RPC): a client sends a request and waits for a response.</p>
<p>The sample RPC service computes Fibonacci numbers on the server. The server uses <strong><code>IResponder</code></strong> on a quorum queue <code>rpc_queue</code>; the client uses <strong><code>IRequester</code></strong> to publish requests and await replies.</p>
