<blockquote>
<h4 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id=a-note-on-rpc>A note on RPC<a href=#a-note-on-rpc class=hash-link aria-label="Direct link to A note on RPC" title="Direct link to A note on RPC" translate=no>​</a></h4>
<p>RPC is common but easy to misuse: keep clear which calls are local vs remote, document dependencies, and handle broker or server outages. When in doubt, prefer asynchronous pipelines over blocking RPC.</p>
